!Name: p90sidelwss-1
!C A period 90 c/3 puffer that produces a sideways LWSS.
!C This works by hitting a p90 spacehip with gliders from a p90
!C forwards rake.  Delaying the gliders from the rake by one generation
!C produces MWSS's instead.  This is an improvement of a previous
!C version of this rake.
!C David I. Bell, August 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
!
